{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CLLocationDirection","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@CLLocationDirection"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"direction","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The value ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" means that the top edge of the map view corresponds to true","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"north. The value ","type":"text"},{"code":"90","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" means the top of the map is pointing due east. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value ","type":"text"},{"code":"180","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" means the top of the map points due south, and so on.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Changing the value of this property updates the map view immediately. If you","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"want to animate the change, use the ","type":"text"},{"code":"-setDirection:animated:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" method instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapview\/direction"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView\/direction","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The heading of the map, measured in degrees clockwise from true north."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"title":"direction","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"direction"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibr